	"Description": "v. 1.0 -\u00A06/15/22\n<br />This mod adds some Portland and PNW-specific flavor to Stardew Valley with content packs for Content Patcher, STF, and PFM. This mod doesn't change anything fundamental about the game mechanics, only adds aesthetics, new objects, and a few events.\n<br />\n<br />Enhance your Stardew Valley experience with:   \n<br />   \uFEFF- A TriMet bus re-skin, including an upgraded paint job on repair\n<br />   \uFEFF- PNW-native forage for all 4 seasons\n<br />   \uFEFF- Cannabis growing and crafting\n<br />   \uFEFF\uFEFF- More roses, crows, and other Portland-inspired details sprinkled throughout\u00A0\n<br />   \uFEFF- A certain carpet\n<br />\n<br />The following mods are required for Willamette Valley to work:\n<br />\n<br />Content Patcher\n<br />JSON Assets\n<br />Mail Framework Mod\n<br />Producer Framework Mod\n<br />Farm Type Manager\n<br />Shop Tile Framework\n<br />\n<br />This is my first substantial mod - I'm grateful for any helpful feedback and will do my best to troubleshoot. Thanks for playing!\n<br />--SPUD",
